<title>FRANCE: French cocoa bean imports up yr/yr in January.</title>
<headline>French cocoa bean imports up yr/yr in January.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>French January cocoa bean imports issued by French customs (in tonnes) -</p>
<p>		    Jan 97	   Jan 96	 Jan/Dec 96</p>
<p>Ivory Coast	8,721	   4,541	   67,407</p>
<p>Ghana		1,037	   1,310	   13,978</p>
<p>Nigeria	    1,498	   1,153	   11,634</p>
<p>Cameroon	     402	     640	    9,806</p>
<p>Indonesia	    775	   1,435	    9,610</p>
<p>World Total     12,820	   9,838	  119,840</p>
<p>Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
